        "LocalizationKey": "Forest_Lore_RuinedHomestead_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A homestead at the edge of the river meadow, long since left to the weather. The roof has fallen in, the fence is down and grass grows over the threshold, but the walls still stand. Salvage what is left in the wreck first; then patch the walls and roof with planks and rope, and the place will keep the rain off again."
